{"id":"000W18","title":"Broodje Kroket","author":"PrissyP","solvedCount":5,"difficulty":3,"rating":"N/A","firstSeen":"2026-11-13T17:50:10+00:00","posted":"Heute, 11:09 Uhr","rules":"Rules\n\nChaos Construction:\n\nDivide the grid into four regions of orthogonally connected cells, and fill each region with the digits 1–9 so that digits don't repeat in any row, column or region.\n\nDutch Flatmates:\n\nEvery 5 in the grid must have a 1 directly above it or a 9 directly below it. It may have both, but it doesn't need both. Any such 1 or 9 belongs to the same region as the 5.\n\nSandwich Clues:\n\nThe clues outside the grid are equal to the sum of the digits located between the highest and lowest digit in that row or column. All digits between those two belong to the same region.\n\nDiamonds:\n\nCells marked with a diamond contain the same digit.","solutionCode":"Row 6, left to right with a - for region borders","tags":["Sudoku","Sandwich (Variante)","Chaos Construction (Variante)"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/k180n8kz1u","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/k180n8kz1u","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":6,"cols":6,"cages":0,"hasSolution":true,"features":["overlays","underlays"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-11-13T17:50:10+00:00"}